'''''Stars Spun, Prescience Sprung''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Windswept Wanderlust]].

==Steps==
# Search for any clues that may be related to Kafka
# After collecting clues related to Kafka, start tracking her
# Use Diting to track down Kafka's whereabouts
# Chase Kafka
# Reach the other side of the gate and continue to track Kafka
# Chase Kafka
# Find another path to pursue Kafka
# Find another path by which to pursue Kafka

