:'''Kafka:''' Welcome, Astral Expressers. Looks like you caught me.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You're finished, surrender!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You have the right to remain silent...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} This was all part of your plan.
:'''Kafka:''' ...
:'''Welt:''' Admit it, Kafka. You planned for us to come here.
:'''Kafka:''' I didn't plan anything. It was the future. We interfere on countless future possibilities and make the best future a reality.
:'''Kafka:''' You speak too highly of us, Welt. The Stellaron Hunters are merely destiny's slaves.
:'''March 7th:''' Best future? Best for who? As if you'd consider anyone but yourself.
:'''Kafka:''' If I said "best for the universe," would you believe me? Hehe... Best for me, naturally.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Surrender, and save your explanations for the Xianzhou.
::Surrender, and save your explanations for the Xianzhou.
::If you want a fight, quit stalling!
::I have a lot to ask you...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} If you want a fight, quit stalling!
::Surrender, and save your explanations for the Xianzhou.
::If you want a fight, quit stalling!
::I have a lot to ask you...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I have a lot to ask you...
:'''Welt:''' We're taking you to see the general of the Luofu. You can profess your innocence all you like, but the general will decide your fate.
:'''Kafka:''' Oh thanks, but no thanks. I can't stand moving at someone else's pace.
:{{tx}}
;(Enter battle)
:{{Список врагов|mode=sent|Mara-Struck Warden*1; Imaginary Weaver*1; Mara-Struck Soldier*1}}
----
;([[#Gallery|Cutscene]] plays)
::Finally.
::Rudimentary.
::Your every move...
::...has been foreseen...
::...by the omniscia.
::Fu Xuan, Divination Commission.
::I'll be taking the criminal from here.
;(Cutscene ends)
----
----
:'''Fu Xuan:''' Greetings, crew of the Astral Express. This is our first encounter... though given that I have encountered you in foresight, perhaps I should say the second. I am Fu Xuan, master diviner at the Divination Commission and one of the Six Charioteers.
:'''Fu Xuan:''' Far-flung friends ought to be received with fine wine, but alas, the heavens, earth, and body are not aligned for such an occasion. You'll allow for a postponement of the usual formalities, I trust? We should begin with the matter at hand.
:'''March 7th:''' ...What the actual heck is she saying?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} She's just showing off with some big and fancy words.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Even my Synesthesia Beacon can't make sense of what she said.
:'''Fu Xuan:''' Ahem! If the method of my speech is offensive to you, you need but say.
:'''Welt:''' We received an assignment from General Jing Yuan to arrest the Stellaron Hunter. Thank you, diviner, for coming to our aid, but we must escort the fugitive to the general.
:'''Fu Xuan:''' Inessential. I hold a proclamation from the general here, if you care to see. Upon detaining the Stellaron Hunter, questioning and all further arrangements are to be undertaken by the Divination Commission.
:'''March 7th:''' Did the general just spare us a walk with Kafka? I knew he was a good guy~
:'''Welt:''' Understood. However, the general promised that all intel would be shared with us. We have a right to know anything that Kafka divulges.
:'''Fu Xuan:''' ...Oh?
:'''Fu Xuan:''' That guy... Can I go one day without him throwing me under the&mdash;
:'''Welt:''' We won't make things anymore complicated than they need to be. We just want to listen in on the questioning.
:'''Fu Xuan:''' Very well, urgency demands fluidity... The three of you shall accompany me to the Divination Commission.
:'''March 7th:''' Can't we do the questioning here? The Stellaron Hunters are slippery, what if she makes a break for it?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Here would be better.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We shouldn't delay.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Are you guys up to this?
:'''Fu Xuan:''' While I am here, she will not escape. Only the Divination Commission has the methods to make her talk and bring the truth to light.
:'''Fu Xuan:''' The time has arrived. We must depart. Please, proceed.
----
{{Dialogue End}}

